    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ALYSSA: Coulda been worse - we could have not met at all.\nOC SINGER: Thank you. Thanks.\nSINGER: A long time ago, we used to have this bass player who took off one day to draw funny books or something. Maybe you've seen her stuff - it's …\nSINGER: But what a lot of people don't know is that she used to harbor these delusions that she could sing. And she used to subject us to these thro…",
      "ALYSSA: No, I should apologize. I don't usually get all mushy in public. But it's been awhile since I've seen Kim here.\nKIM: Tell me you didn't set that gross display up with the band just so you could nail me.\nALYSSA: Like I'd have to go through that much effort\nKIM: You know what! I want to dance.",
      "JANE: Yeah Alyssa - who've you been shacking up with?\nALYSSA: 'Shacking up!' Please. I'm so in love!\nALYSSA: I know. I know -I feel like such a goon. But I can't help it - we have such a great time together."
    ]
